#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Cacti records this outcome before verifying account enabled, realm authorization, or 2FA completion; a session may not have been established."
msgstr "Cacti hurekodi matokeo haya kabla ya kuthibitisha kama akaunti imewashwa, idhini ya eneo (realm), au ukamilishaji wa 2FA; huenda kipindi hakijaanzishwa."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "No current Cacti path writes this signature; recorded defensively as a possible password change with an unconfirmed outcome."
msgstr "Hakuna njia ya sasa ya Cacti inayoandika saini hii; imerekodiwa kwa tahadhari kama uwezekano wa mabadiliko ya nenosiri yenye matokeo yasiyothibitishwa."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Cacti user_log result=3 with user_id=0 may be a password change or a failed 2FA challenge; the table cannot disambiguate."
msgstr "Cacti user_log result=3 yenye user_id=0 inaweza kuwa mabadiliko ya nenosiri au jaribio la 2FA lililoshindwa; jedwali haliwezi kutofautisha."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Audit administration permission is required to save these settings."
msgstr "Ruhusa ya usimamizi wa ukaguzi inahitajika ili kuhifadhi mipangilio hii."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Authentication auditing was not enabled. Run the audit_auth_indexes.php CLI maintenance command first."
msgstr "Ukaguzi wa uthibitishaji haukuwa umewashwa. Tekeleza amri ya matengenezo ya CLI audit_auth_indexes.php kwanza."

