msgstr "Usaidizi wa Kiufundi"

#: setup.php
msgid "View Audit Log"
msgstr "Tazama Kumbukumbu ya Ukaguzi"

#: setup.php
msgid "Allows Administrators to view change activity on the Cacti server.  Administrators can also export the audit log for analysis purposes."
msgstr "Huruhusu Wasimamizi kutazama shughuli za mabadiliko kwenye seva ya Cacti.  Wasimamizi wanaweza pia kuhamisha kumbukumbu ya ukaguzi kwa madhumuni ya uchambuzi."

#: setup.php
